# The incubus from Orgrimmar: Devourer of Souls (1507) from Gan'rul
# Bloodeye to Cazul, Love Hurts (65601) to Magar, Wish You Were Here (65610,
# the Withered Scarf at Fallen Sky Lake in Ashenvale) and The Binding (65604)
# at the summoning circle in Neeru Fireblade's tent.
# Sources: quests.json, npcs.json and items.json (Questie 12.1.0 and
# Questie-Forever) for the givers, the scarf's droppers and the summoning
# circle; Wowhead Forever's Warlock class page
# (data/local/quest-audit/wowhead-class-quests.json): Forever gives the chain
# level 20 (Wish You Were Here level 27, 2200 experience) and lists a Small
# Soul Pouch as The Binding's reward. Forever's data does not list the spell;
# in Classic it is Summon Incubus (Wowpedia, "The Binding (Incubus,
# Orgrimmar)"), and Wowpedia ("Incubus (warlock minion)") describes the
# incubus as the male sayaad, the succubus's counterpart. Wowpedia is
# Classic-only: neither point is confirmed in Forever.
# Gan'rul's Devourer of Souls and Carendin Halgar's in the Undercity exclude
# each other: this guide is for warlocks who took Gan'rul's, as the Horde
# leveling guides do (forever/horde/04-the-barrens, the succubus); the others
# follow forever/class/warlock/incubus-undercity. Accepts and turn-ins you
# already have tick off.
# The Withered Scarf drops from the Shadethicket bog beasts (25-30) at about
# one in twenty (Questie-Forever's rate): come at 27 or later.

step Devourer of Souls
  tip At 20 Gan'rul Bloodeye, in the Cleft of Shadow under the Valley of Strength, sends you to Cazul a few steps away.
  level 20
  accept 1507                         -- Gan'rul Bloodeye
  turnin 1507                         -- Cazul
  accept 65601

step Magar
  tip Magar keeps Magar's Cloth Goods, east of the Cleft of Shadow along the main street. He asks you to look for his mate, Krilge.
  turnin 65601                        -- Magar
  accept 65610

step Fallen Sky Lake
  zone Ashenvale
  tip Fallen Sky Lake lies in southern Ashenvale, south of Splintertree Post. The Shadethicket bog beasts around the lake drop the Withered Scarf, about one in twenty.
  collect 190232 quest 65610.1        -- Withered Scarf

step The Binding
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip Back to Gan'rul in the Cleft of Shadow. Take the scarf to the summoning circle in Neeru Fireblade's tent nearby and defeat the incubus it calls.
  turnin 65610                        -- Gan'rul Bloodeye
  accept 65604
  kill 185335 quest 65604.1           -- Summoned Incubus
  turnin 65604                        -- Gan'rul Bloodeye: he binds the incubus to you
